WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:37.017
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:37.287 --> 00:40.666
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

3
00:47.089 --> 00:49.757
I was hoping you might stay a little longer.

4
00:49.758 --> 00:50.926
Such a pity.

5
00:52.678 --> 00:54.595
As lovely as that would be,

6
00:54.596 --> 00:56.598
my coronation will soon take place.

7
00:57.307 --> 00:59.893
The first coronation of an unwedded queen.

8
01:03.355 --> 01:05.816
There is nothing wrong with being unmarried.

9
01:06.483 --> 01:08.651
You will govern your country well.

10
01:08.652 --> 01:10.945
That is what truly matters for a good queen.

11
01:10.946 --> 01:12.489
Yes, but my uncles...

12
01:13.073 --> 01:15.492
I'm afraid they do not recognize my birthright.

13
01:15.993 --> 01:19.454
They each think their son ought to be the one taking my throne.

14
01:20.122 --> 01:22.708
And my sister's at the palace on her own.

15
01:23.584 --> 01:25.085
I'm concerned for her.

16
01:29.381 --> 01:30.549
We support you.

17
01:31.258 --> 01:33.259
The Eastern Empire is on your side.

18
01:33.260 --> 01:35.137
We have faith in your authority.

19
01:37.222 --> 01:38.765
That means so much to me.

20
01:39.349 --> 01:41.101
I would like to propose a solution.

21
01:42.269 --> 01:44.730
Which uncle is making the most difficulty?

22
01:46.648 --> 01:48.274
The worst is Grand Duke Berg.

23
01:48.275 --> 01:49.609
Might I request

24
01:50.110 --> 01:52.320
that the Grand Duke posts his son to us as an envoy?

25
01:52.321 --> 01:53.612
An envoy?

26
01:53.613 --> 01:55.740
There are three different kinds of envoy.

27
01:55.741 --> 01:57.366
First, there's a commissaire,

28
01:57.367 --> 01:58.659
sent on official duties.

29
01:58.660 --> 02:00.369
A pardoned envoy,

30
02:00.370 --> 02:01.871
smuggled abroad in disgrace.

31
02:01.872 --> 02:03.080
Then the pawn,

32
02:03.081 --> 02:05.458
a hostage envoy, as leverage.

33
02:05.459 --> 02:06.960
That's the one we need.

34
02:07.502 --> 02:09.421
Grand Duke Berg's son is perfect.

35
02:10.047 --> 02:13.383
The Duke will not be able to do you any harm, Princess Circe.

36
02:16.219 --> 02:17.762
Thank you, my friend.

37
02:17.763 --> 02:19.597
How can I repay this kindness?

38
02:19.598 --> 02:21.432
Be a good queen,

39
02:21.433 --> 02:23.268
and make your country thrive.

40
02:36.657 --> 02:37.948
Thank you.

41
02:37.949 --> 02:39.158
I'll do as you say.

42
02:39.159 --> 02:40.952
I will always be your supporter,

43
02:41.620 --> 02:42.996
political ally...

44
02:43.664 --> 02:44.748
and be your friend.

45
02:47.417 --> 02:48.752
Then I am lucky.

46
03:03.558 --> 03:05.017
Your Majesty,

47
03:05.018 --> 03:06.728
Prince Heinrey is asking to see you.

48
03:07.562 --> 03:08.854
Is the Prince here?

49
03:08.855 --> 03:09.981
Yes, Your Majesty.

50
03:38.135 --> 03:39.136
Your Majesty!

51
03:40.429 --> 03:41.596
What has brought you here?

52
03:42.180 --> 03:44.683
I thought you might be finished with your duties around now.

53
03:45.142 --> 03:46.143
Am I right?

54
03:46.768 --> 03:48.186
Yes, I am finished.

55
03:49.604 --> 03:52.607
Then, could we take a walk together?

56
03:53.442 --> 03:55.026
It is so vast at this palace.

57
03:55.861 --> 03:58.070
I would very much enjoy a tour.

58
03:58.071 --> 04:00.991
Perhaps you could show me one or two of your favorite places.

59
04:02.033 --> 04:03.118
I would love that.

60
04:24.097 --> 04:25.474
I was just deciding

61
04:26.016 --> 04:27.642
where I should take you.

62
04:30.395 --> 04:32.730
I was looking at that painting.

63
04:32.731 --> 04:33.982
Is it you as a child?

64
04:36.276 --> 04:37.444
How did you know?

65
04:38.195 --> 04:40.572
So you've always liked birds, I suppose?

66
04:41.364 --> 04:42.699
Is Queen well?

67
04:43.575 --> 04:44.825
He's very well.

68
04:44.826 --> 04:46.870
It seems you are not sending him anymore?

69
04:49.873 --> 04:51.957
I will come instead of sending Queen,

70
04:51.958 --> 04:53.334
so we can see each other.

71
04:53.335 --> 04:55.378
If you have grounded my favorite bird,

72
04:56.129 --> 04:57.214
then perhaps

73
04:57.714 --> 04:59.299
I shall have to reconsider being friends.

74
05:00.091 --> 05:01.676
Isn't your birthday quite soon?

75
05:04.846 --> 05:06.264
How did you know that?

76
05:06.848 --> 05:10.351
As it's just after the new year, and that time is hectic,

77
05:10.352 --> 05:11.853
I heard you often spend it quietly.

78
05:13.522 --> 05:15.981
I wanted to share your birthday with you.

79
05:15.982 --> 05:17.484
So I extended my visit here.

80
05:21.613 --> 05:23.572
Um... um... uh...

81
05:23.573 --> 05:25.115
I didn't mean just the two of us.

82
05:25.116 --> 05:26.200
Uh, we could...

83
05:26.201 --> 05:28.787
we could ask Circe, McKenna, and a few other friends.

84
05:29.287 --> 05:30.914
We could have dinner together.

85
05:33.124 --> 05:34.125
Why not?

86
05:35.126 --> 05:36.460
How perfect.

87
05:36.461 --> 05:38.338
The year would begin on a happy note.

88
05:39.923 --> 05:40.924
I'd like that.

89
05:41.633 --> 05:42.758
Wonderful.

90
05:42.759 --> 05:44.719
Your Majesty?

91
05:47.138 --> 05:49.515
I think you should step inside for a moment.

92
05:49.516 --> 05:51.852
There's a message from His Majesty the Emperor.

93
06:15.417 --> 06:16.668
Hmm?

94
06:18.253 --> 06:20.004
Do you think the dust will settle, Lante?

95
06:20.005 --> 06:21.089
Well, Sire...

96
06:21.715 --> 06:25.217
Our future generations deserve a strong empire, Your Majesty.

97
06:25.218 --> 06:27.678
A poor relationship between the Emperor and Empress

98
06:27.679 --> 06:29.556
is not in the kingdom's interests.

99
06:33.643 --> 06:34.686
"Dearest,

100
06:35.478 --> 06:37.772
"come to think of it, your birthday is coming up soon."

101
06:39.482 --> 06:43.320
Did His Majesty ask you to read it out like that?

102
06:44.154 --> 06:46.405
Continue. Continue the message.

103
06:46.406 --> 06:47.990
In your voice.

104
06:47.991 --> 06:50.117
"We have grown somewhat distant as of late,

105
06:50.118 --> 06:51.785
"and I thought perhaps, to reconcile,

106
06:51.786 --> 06:53.955
"we should go to the Imperial Villa for your birthday.

107
06:56.791 --> 06:57.876
"Empress...

108
06:58.877 --> 07:00.670
"What are your thoughts on this?"

109
07:02.422 --> 07:03.964
How should I reply?

110
07:03.965 --> 07:07.719
Tell me what to say, and I will deliver it to His Majesty as faithfully as possible.

111
07:11.264 --> 07:13.349
Your Majesty, you also wish to restore

112
07:13.350 --> 07:15.559
your relationship with Her Majesty, do you not?

113
07:15.560 --> 07:17.186
Everything I do, she fights against.

114
07:17.187 --> 07:20.230
You have to know that you hurt her, Your Majesty.

115
07:20.231 --> 07:22.941
You must also consider the feeling of major betrayal she has.

116
07:28.823 --> 07:31.576
I know you covet our reconciliation, and I have reached out to her.

117
07:32.577 --> 07:34.245
I'd be surprised if she agrees.

118
07:34.829 --> 07:37.081
In fact, I believe that her pride will obstruct her.

119
07:37.082 --> 07:39.083
She won't consent to this proposal.

120
07:45.340 --> 07:46.758
So, what did she say?

121
07:49.844 --> 07:51.346
"Your Majesty's request...

122
07:53.390 --> 07:54.641
"was received.

123
07:59.646 --> 08:00.729
"It is accepted."

124
08:03.650 --> 08:04.901
Yes!

125
08:09.364 --> 08:10.407
I'll be needing a gift!

126
08:11.282 --> 08:12.616
I'll find the perfect present!

127
08:12.617 --> 08:14.034
Wait, I have something in mind.

128
08:14.035 --> 08:15.119
Your Majesty!

129
08:15.120 --> 08:17.664
I bought a gift to give to Navier a while ago, in fact.

130
08:18.581 --> 08:20.083
Since her birthday is close to New Year.

131
08:20.917 --> 08:22.459
It was a nuisance keeping it stored,

132
08:22.460 --> 08:23.877
so that works.

133
08:23.878 --> 08:25.046
Wouldn't you say?

134
08:27.632 --> 08:28.841
Yes.

135
08:30.176 --> 08:33.888
I will coordinate the schedule for your trip to the Imperial Villa.

136
08:34.973 --> 08:36.182
Please do so.

137
08:41.229 --> 08:43.439
It was a hard decision to make.

138
08:43.440 --> 08:44.691
You did the right thing.

139
08:46.985 --> 08:48.403
So much has changed.

140
08:49.904 --> 08:51.656
I cannot know if this time together

141
08:52.574 --> 08:54.451
will ease the awkwardness between us.

142
08:55.118 --> 08:56.577
However,

143
08:56.578 --> 08:58.371
I am this country's Empress.

144
08:59.914 --> 09:01.708
It is my job to show my country

145
09:02.333 --> 09:03.959
that we are both united.

146
09:03.960 --> 09:05.503
We are still husband and wife.

147
09:06.629 --> 09:09.174
I'm positive the two of you will be reconciled.

148
09:12.010 --> 09:13.844
I shall make every preparation.

149
09:13.845 --> 09:15.805
Know that your stay will have nothing missing.

150
09:36.034 --> 09:37.827
It's one of Queen's feathers.

151
09:38.745 --> 09:42.123
When you heard I was writing to you, I hope you weren't disappointed.

152
09:43.917 --> 09:45.834
I was overjoyed.

153
09:55.386 --> 09:57.179
I wanted to share your birthday with you,

154
09:57.180 --> 09:58.848
so I extended my visit here.

155
10:01.059 --> 10:02.142
Why not?

156
10:02.143 --> 10:03.478
How perfect.

157
10:04.354 --> 10:06.605
The year would begin on a happy note.

158
10:06.606 --> 10:07.689
Wonderful.

159
10:41.307 --> 10:42.808
Queen!

160
10:56.614 --> 10:58.031
Ah!

161
10:58.032 --> 10:59.617
It has been so long!

162
11:01.077 --> 11:03.121
Have you been keeping well?

163
11:05.165 --> 11:06.749
My, how I missed you.

164
11:07.709 --> 11:09.335
I wonder if you missed me?

165
11:14.215 --> 11:16.425
I see you brought no letter with you today.

166
11:19.137 --> 11:20.888
Isn't your master compassionate?

167
11:20.889 --> 11:23.224
You're here because I said I missed you!

168
11:32.233 --> 11:33.568
What's that fragrance?

169
11:35.069 --> 11:37.446
Is that Heinrey's scent on you, Queen?

170
11:56.299 --> 11:57.926
I have to write a letter now.

171
11:59.552 --> 12:00.637
A hard one.

172
12:02.847 --> 12:05.225
I have difficult news for your guardian.

173
12:07.894 --> 12:09.854
Heinrey has made me feel less alone.

174
12:11.439 --> 12:13.399
He showed me what true happiness is.

175
12:35.505 --> 12:40.008
"I will not be able to keep my promise to spend my birthday with you.

176
12:40.009 --> 12:43.929
"His Majesty asked that I spend it at the Imperial Villa with him...

177
12:43.930 --> 12:45.764
"...and I have agreed.

178
12:49.394 --> 12:50.770
"I am sorry."

179
13:03.449 --> 13:06.828
You're not really thinking of giving all these jewels to the Empress?

180
13:07.412 --> 13:08.454
Are you?

181
13:14.752 --> 13:16.837
I had believed it was a game in the beginning,

182
13:16.838 --> 13:18.631
since that is what you told me it was.

183
13:19.299 --> 13:21.050
I can see why you're attracted to her.

184
13:21.968 --> 13:23.552
She is charming and beautiful.

185
13:23.553 --> 13:26.681
But now, take a look at the state she's left you in, Your Highness.

186
13:27.807 --> 13:29.017
I'm concerned by it.

187
13:29.851 --> 13:32.019
A hot air balloon, and now jewels too?

188
13:32.020 --> 13:33.479
What on earth are you thinking?

189
13:34.314 --> 13:35.690
Oh, have you been crying?

190
13:38.192 --> 13:39.819
I'm not crying. You're crying.

191
13:41.404 --> 13:42.487
You were crying.

192
13:44.282 --> 13:45.407
No, I wasn't.

193
13:45.408 --> 13:46.825
Your throat just trembled.

194
13:46.826 --> 13:49.703
And I can see that your eyelashes are still wet.

195
13:49.704 --> 13:51.538
You've made your eyes puffy and red.

196
13:51.539 --> 13:52.623
I have not.

197
13:57.712 --> 13:59.797
Well, I might have a walk and some air.

198
14:20.318 --> 14:21.903
Majesty!

199
14:25.531 --> 14:27.949
I am told you're taking Her Highness to the Imperial Villa

200
14:27.950 --> 14:29.368
to honor her birthday.

201
14:29.994 --> 14:31.204
Are you about to depart?

202
14:31.704 --> 14:32.705
That's right.

203
14:33.206 --> 14:34.456
You're so sweet.

204
14:34.457 --> 14:35.582
Also...

205
14:35.583 --> 14:37.585
you look so, so handsome today!

206
14:38.169 --> 14:39.545
It's unfair, don't you think?

207
14:40.129 --> 14:43.299
That the Eastern Empire's ruler is also such a handsome man?

208
14:43.883 --> 14:45.008
Silly thing.

209
14:45.009 --> 14:46.844
Take Rashta with you as well.

210
14:47.428 --> 14:50.598
I do think Rashta should also be there to honor the Empress.

211
14:52.850 --> 14:53.851
Charming.

212
14:54.769 --> 14:56.019
But not this time.

213
14:56.020 --> 14:57.479
We would like to celebrate on our own.

214
14:59.982 --> 15:01.317
I thought you might.

215
15:08.491 --> 15:09.951
Majesty!

216
15:12.453 --> 15:15.248
Do not have too much fun with her, and come back soon.

217
15:17.500 --> 15:19.085
Your Rashta will be waiting for you.

218
15:21.546 --> 15:22.880
We... we shouldn't be late.

219
15:24.006 --> 15:25.465
indeed.

220
15:25.466 --> 15:26.884
Take care of yourself.

221
16:25.651 --> 16:27.195
Let's depart!

222
16:33.075 --> 16:35.744
I was panicking for a while that Her Majesty might refuse.

223
16:35.745 --> 16:37.495
It wasn't romantic enough at all.

224
16:37.496 --> 16:40.082
Just a letter read out loud. Not even an apology?

225
16:40.750 --> 16:42.167
Please don't get me started.

226
16:42.168 --> 16:45.045
Even just to get the word "reconcile" put into that letter,

227
16:45.046 --> 16:47.756
oh, believe me, I really had to beg.

228
16:50.009 --> 16:51.301
Listen...

229
16:51.302 --> 16:52.802
We must get this to work.

230
16:52.803 --> 16:53.887
Hmm? Hmm?

231
16:53.888 --> 16:54.971
- We'll make it! - Hmm.

232
17:33.594 --> 17:34.679
Do you...

233
17:36.180 --> 17:37.807
recall our first visit here?

234
17:39.308 --> 17:40.977
I recall your motion sickness.

235
17:41.561 --> 17:43.020
You were just a child.

236
17:44.355 --> 17:46.691
And only a mere princess as well.

237
17:48.651 --> 17:50.653
So sweet.

238
17:57.743 --> 17:59.578
Do you still feel poorly?

239
18:00.788 --> 18:03.164
Are you all right?

240
18:10.298 --> 18:12.508
Oh. I'm fine now.

241
18:18.055 --> 18:19.139
Take them.

242
18:19.140 --> 18:20.891
I promise you'll feel better.

243
18:22.143 --> 18:24.145
Go on. Just put this leaf in your mouth.

244
18:26.480 --> 18:27.565
Ah.

245
18:35.781 --> 18:36.907
That's better, thank you.

246
18:38.200 --> 18:40.535
I wish we could come here again.

247
18:40.536 --> 18:41.662
How would we find it?

248
18:42.204 --> 18:43.288
We could leave a sign.

249
18:43.289 --> 18:44.664
Like what?

250
18:44.665 --> 18:45.832
Hmm.

251
18:45.833 --> 18:47.000
Let's plant a tree.

252
18:47.001 --> 18:48.084
How?

253
18:48.085 --> 18:49.502
We can plant the seeds.

254
18:49.503 --> 18:51.087
We'll have one each.

255
18:51.088 --> 18:52.255
One for me.

256
18:52.256 --> 18:53.424
The other for you.

257
18:57.428 --> 18:59.639
Are these really our little trees?

258
19:01.182 --> 19:02.350
They are.

259
19:05.686 --> 19:07.271
They have grown so tall.

260
19:08.731 --> 19:10.775
I did often think of our trees.

261
19:11.609 --> 19:13.485
I thought they would be lost.

262
19:13.486 --> 19:17.239
I have ensured these trees were taken care of since then.

263
19:43.349 --> 19:44.766
My lady.

264
19:44.767 --> 19:46.227
There's a guest here for you.

265
19:47.144 --> 19:48.437
I am not seeing anyone.

266
19:49.146 --> 19:50.230
But, Ms. Rashta--

267
19:50.231 --> 19:51.690
I told you.

268
19:51.691 --> 19:52.858
Send them away.

269
19:56.237 --> 19:57.696
He swore if you won't see him now,

270
19:57.697 --> 19:59.739
then you'll regret the consequences.

271
19:59.740 --> 20:01.324
Consequences?

272
20:01.325 --> 20:03.035
Who dares to say that to Rashta?

273
20:03.869 --> 20:05.746
You're looking almost like a noblewoman.

274
20:35.025 --> 20:36.277
But I know what you are.

275
20:45.494 --> 20:46.620
Why...

276
20:48.622 --> 20:49.790
did you come...

277
20:51.917 --> 20:53.626
How did you gain entry here?

278
20:55.171 --> 20:56.254
I think...

279
20:56.255 --> 20:58.716
it would be better for these girls not to hear us.

280
21:11.061 --> 21:12.062
Ah.

281
21:14.899 --> 21:17.567
Is this trinket made of real gold and amber?

282
21:17.568 --> 21:19.153
Let me see.

283
21:23.115 --> 21:26.285
You should not treat me so wickedly, should you, Rashta?

284
21:27.912 --> 21:29.245
This is your doing.

285
21:29.246 --> 21:31.664
When you got caught, they removed my eye.

286
21:31.665 --> 21:32.666
Hmm.

287
21:33.709 --> 21:35.211
And yet for you...

288
21:36.629 --> 21:38.798
I've been keeping your secret.

289
21:40.758 --> 21:42.300
Your precious golden trinkets

290
21:42.301 --> 21:45.012
would never be enough to pay what I'm owed.

291
21:46.806 --> 21:49.600
So don't make that nasty pouting face.

292
21:50.643 --> 21:51.644
Hmm?

293
21:52.853 --> 21:54.562
Do not place your hands on me!

294
21:54.563 --> 21:56.607
His Highness will not forgive you.

295
22:00.653 --> 22:01.779
Right.

296
22:02.279 --> 22:05.574
And what does His Highness really know about your history?

297
22:07.159 --> 22:10.996
Does he know you gave birth in secrecy to another man's child?

298
22:12.873 --> 22:17.878
And does he know that you abandoned your poor child like an old doll

299
22:19.004 --> 22:20.589
and scurried away?

300
22:21.340 --> 22:22.466
I bet not.

301
22:23.008 --> 22:24.134
Abandoned?

302
22:25.219 --> 22:26.637
What on earth do you mean?

303
22:27.346 --> 22:30.265
How dare you lie when you took my child and killed it!

304
22:30.266 --> 22:31.433
Shh!

305
22:35.479 --> 22:38.022
You threaten me with the baby's existence,

306
22:38.023 --> 22:39.941
but all I have to do is deny it.

307
22:39.942 --> 22:43.195
It's a worthless threat when we both know there's no child.

308
22:47.408 --> 22:49.076
Your child is alive.

309
22:51.287 --> 22:52.453
I do not believe you.

310
22:52.454 --> 22:54.582
As lowborn as he indeed was...

311
22:55.374 --> 22:57.001
he is still my grandson.

312
22:57.668 --> 22:59.753
You believed that I would kill the child?

313
23:05.634 --> 23:07.469
You... you said he was dead.

314
23:09.346 --> 23:11.431
You even said you...

315
23:11.432 --> 23:13.182
that you did it yourself.

316
23:13.183 --> 23:14.643
Not really.

317
23:15.769 --> 23:19.397
You don't know whether you want your boy dead or alive.

318
23:19.398 --> 23:20.774
So which one is it?

319
23:21.734 --> 23:24.320
You don't believe me, do you?

320
23:25.112 --> 23:26.405
Shall I show you?

321
23:31.035 --> 23:32.201
Oh my...

322
23:36.916 --> 23:38.876
I'll be here again soon to see you...

323
23:39.376 --> 23:40.793
so have something to give me.

324
23:40.794 --> 23:42.629
If you don't have money,

325
23:42.630 --> 23:44.298
then your jewels will do.

326
23:45.382 --> 23:46.634
Cheerio, my dear.

327
24:00.648 --> 24:02.565
Ms. Rashta! Oh no!

328
24:02.566 --> 24:04.025
Are you all right?

329
24:04.026 --> 24:06.195
What do we do? Fetch some water!

330
24:38.560 --> 24:39.769
Who is it?

331
24:39.770 --> 24:41.480
I have a message.

332
24:47.695 --> 24:48.778
What is it now?

333
24:48.779 --> 24:51.115
It's Ms. Rashta. She has suddenly fallen ill.

334
24:53.367 --> 24:54.450
That's it?

335
24:54.451 --> 24:56.452
She is suffering from chills and a fever,

336
24:56.453 --> 24:58.997
so the Imperial Physician decided to treat her.

337
25:02.543 --> 25:05.212
Go and tell the Physician that he did the right thing.

338
25:05.879 --> 25:08.673
If she gets any worse, report it to me without delay.

339
25:08.674 --> 25:10.259
Yes, Your Majesty.

340
25:19.476 --> 25:20.477
Tell me...

341
25:21.228 --> 25:23.104
Do you suppose she's feigning it?

342
25:23.105 --> 25:24.273
That may be.

343
25:24.773 --> 25:28.485
But the physician, he would not have sent a message if that were the case.

344
25:29.278 --> 25:30.361
You're right.

345
25:30.362 --> 25:32.239
I know he will be treating her well.

346
25:33.449 --> 25:34.824
Do not worry.

347
25:34.825 --> 25:36.785
Just enjoy being here with the Empress.

348
25:38.579 --> 25:39.621
Hmm.

349
25:47.212 --> 25:50.548
Mmm! This smells delicious.

350
25:50.549 --> 25:52.301
And it looks it, too!

351
25:53.761 --> 25:54.927
You taste it first.

352
25:54.928 --> 25:56.179
- How is it? - It tastes lovely.

353
25:56.180 --> 26:00.016
When Your Majesty cooks anything, I could just keep on eating until I burst!

354
26:00.017 --> 26:01.560
I'm serious!

355
26:07.900 --> 26:09.109
Do come in, Your Majesty.

356
26:10.527 --> 26:11.779
It smells delicious.

357
26:12.780 --> 26:14.907
It's like something my mother used to make.

358
26:15.657 --> 26:17.242
When I was very young.

359
26:20.204 --> 26:23.791
Well, Her Majesty has made this dish all by herself.

360
26:26.085 --> 26:27.710
It looks divine.

361
26:27.711 --> 26:28.712
Doesn't it?

362
27:07.334 --> 27:09.128
I enjoyed hearing your laughter.

363
27:10.629 --> 27:12.255
While I was making this,

364
27:12.256 --> 27:13.714
I had a little something to drink.

365
27:13.715 --> 27:14.925
I feel a little tipsy.

366
27:19.721 --> 27:21.974
I thought perhaps you looked a little flushed.

367
27:23.183 --> 27:24.184
It's pretty.

368
27:31.024 --> 27:32.442
Let's go to Plevor together,

369
27:32.985 --> 27:34.027
to the observatory.

370
27:35.362 --> 27:37.071
I thought you'd want to go there.

371
27:37.072 --> 27:38.322
It's all arranged.

372
28:52.481 --> 28:53.732
Is this a present?

373
29:07.537 --> 29:08.789
It's so beautiful.

374
29:09.665 --> 29:12.584
The yellow jewels were quite troublesome to find.

375
29:13.293 --> 29:14.503
But I know you love them.

376
30:52.601 --> 30:53.602
I need you.

377
30:56.229 --> 30:57.563
I missed you...

378
30:57.564 --> 30:59.065
Rashta.

379
31:15.457 --> 31:16.541
What did you say?

380
31:35.602 --> 31:37.145
Navier, what can I say?

381
31:37.729 --> 31:39.064
It was a mistake.

382
31:41.566 --> 31:42.609
Get out.

383
32:15.100 --> 32:16.350
Hup!

384
33:02.898 --> 33:04.274
Ms. Rashta is critical.

385
33:04.774 --> 33:05.859
She got worse rapidly.

386
33:10.280 --> 33:11.448
When does it end?

387
33:12.324 --> 33:14.201
When it rains, it pours.

388
33:33.386 --> 33:34.803
We're leaving.

389
33:34.804 --> 33:36.306
To the palace.

390
33:37.474 --> 33:38.600
Your Majesty!

391
33:39.309 --> 33:40.392
Your Majesty!

392
33:40.393 --> 33:42.978
Please do not leave, I entreat you.

393
33:42.979 --> 33:44.104
Your Majesty!

394
33:44.105 --> 33:46.607
I'll leave the Empress the royal carriage.

395
33:46.608 --> 33:48.192
That's the limit of my kindness.

396
33:48.193 --> 33:49.194
Hyah!

397
34:23.937 --> 34:24.938
Rashta.

398
34:26.815 --> 34:28.233
You're back.

399
34:28.817 --> 34:32.528
What is going on here? How could anybody get so ill this quickly?

400
34:32.529 --> 34:33.779
Well, I... Your Majesty,

401
34:33.780 --> 34:34.781
I'm sorry.

402
34:36.700 --> 34:39.159
I heard Ms. Rashta could not eat properly,

403
34:39.160 --> 34:40.995
grew dizzy, and collapsed.

404
34:40.996 --> 34:43.747
I was so terribly alarmed that I came to see her at once.

405
34:43.748 --> 34:45.541
In spite of my efforts,

406
34:45.542 --> 34:47.251
her condition left me too concerned,

407
34:47.252 --> 34:49.546
so I called the Imperial Physician.

408
34:56.011 --> 34:57.053
I am...

409
34:57.846 --> 34:59.097
very unwell, aren't I?

410
35:07.105 --> 35:08.314
Uh...

411
35:08.315 --> 35:09.941
I needed to verify this,

412
35:10.650 --> 35:13.569
so I checked twice to be certain.

413
35:13.570 --> 35:14.571
What is it?

414
35:15.447 --> 35:16.740
My congratulations.

415
35:17.616 --> 35:19.408
Rashta is expecting.

416
35:19.409 --> 35:20.535
She will have a child.

417
35:30.295 --> 35:31.462
A child?

418
35:31.463 --> 35:33.380
The pulse is not yet strong,

419
35:33.381 --> 35:34.757
but I can feel it clearly.

420
35:34.758 --> 35:35.883
You're with child, my dear.

421
35:35.884 --> 35:37.761
Good heavens!

422
36:15.382 --> 36:18.093
I have brought news for Her Majesty the Empress.

423
37:21.531 --> 37:23.283
Your Highness!

424
37:23.908 --> 37:24.909
Your Highness!

425
37:25.452 --> 37:27.035
What now?

426
37:27.036 --> 37:28.746
I just heard about this.

427
37:28.747 --> 37:30.248
That mistress is pregnant.

428
37:32.292 --> 37:33.917
- Rashta? - Yes...

429
37:33.918 --> 37:35.295
Rashta.

430
37:36.796 --> 37:38.172
Hold on.

431
37:38.173 --> 37:39.799
What about Navier? Where is she?

432
37:41.843 --> 37:43.343
Has she come back yet?

433
37:43.344 --> 37:44.637
Does she know about this?

434
38:23.009 --> 38:24.803
Rashta is with child.

435
38:27.138 --> 38:28.139
Is she?

436
38:29.599 --> 38:32.185
Do you expect me to be joyous?

437
38:37.357 --> 38:40.193
The child is my firstborn, even if they're not a royal.

438
38:40.985 --> 38:44.238
I do not expect your congratulations. However...

439
38:44.239 --> 38:48.659
Next month, I would like you to commence a payment increase for Rashta.

440
38:48.660 --> 38:50.745
Her allowance must reflect that she is a mother.

441
38:55.291 --> 38:56.501
I shall.

442
39:28.575 --> 39:29.784
Your Majesty...

443
39:32.912 --> 39:34.288
What is it, Eliza?

444
39:34.289 --> 39:35.831
Prince Heinrey is here.

445
39:35.832 --> 39:37.374
He's requested to see you.

446
39:37.375 --> 39:39.252
There's something important he wants to say.

447
39:40.837 --> 39:42.088
Will you show him in?

448
40:31.971 --> 40:34.515
I was thinking you might need comforting today.

449
40:37.560 --> 40:39.269
I thought a hug could help.

450
40:39.270 --> 40:40.480
Is that all right?

451
40:47.445 --> 40:48.862
That's what friends do.

452
40:48.863 --> 40:50.865
They always look out for each other.

453
40:53.952 --> 40:56.162
Mmm. It is all right.

454
42:18.494 --> 42:20.121
You bastard!

455
42:22.623 --> 42:25.042
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS
